                      (    forth6809.asm):06576         ; rather than the reverse) - starting from 0, increments while
                      (    forth6809.asm):06577         ; less than 5. Naturally exercises both of WHILE's outcomes in
                      (    forth6809.asm):06578         ; one test: the continue path 5 times, the exit path once.
                      (    forth6809.asm):06579         ; Verified by hand-trace: WHILE's patched forward offset (10)
                      (    forth6809.asm):06580         ; lands exactly at the final RTS; REPEAT's patched back-edge
                      (    forth6809.asm):06581         ; (-22) lands exactly at BEGIN.
