                      (    forth6809.asm):08551         ; then executes the result. Verifies it pushes its own PFA
                      (    forth6809.asm):08552         ; address (matching VARIABLE's own DOESRT0 behavior - BUFFER:
                      (    forth6809.asm):08553         ; shares it) and that VARHERE genuinely advanced by exactly the
                      (    forth6809.asm):08554         ; requested 10 bytes - not just that some space was reserved.
                      (    forth6809.asm):08555         ; Contents are documented uninitialized, so not checked.
