                      (    forth6809.asm):08848         ; Verifies the default action throws -21 (per DEFER's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):08849         ; documented behavior before IS/DEFER! sets a real target) and
                      (    forth6809.asm):08850         ; that CATCH's own depth-restoration contract holds - same
                      (    forth6809.asm):08851         ; pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier sections.
