                      (    forth6809.asm):19017                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):19018                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
                      (    forth6809.asm):19019                      ; third stack item. Per the ANS spec (forth-standard.org/
                      (    forth6809.asm):19020                      ; standard/string/SUBSTITUTE), SUBSTITUTE must scan for
