                      (    forth6809.asm):19027                      ; delimiters and all (count unchanged); an unpaired
                      (    forth6809.asm):19028                      ; trailing '%' with no closing delimiter passes the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19029                      ; residue through unchanged. Confirmed via MAME testing
                      (    forth6809.asm):19030                      ; against a real template. GLOBALS is fully packed
