                      (    forth6809.asm):19246                                  ; codes on genuine 6809 (same class as STOD's
                      (    forth6809.asm):19247                                  ; own fix elsewhere in this file), so BPL was
                      (    forth6809.asm):19248                                  ; testing whatever flags an unrelated, earlier
                      (    forth6809.asm):19249                                  ; instruction happened to leave set, not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19250                                  ; sign of the value just popped. TSTA
