                      (    forth6809.asm):19252                                  ; before the branch that depends on it. The
                      (    forth6809.asm):19253                                  ; four existing internal callers (DOT/DOTR/
                      (    forth6809.asm):19254                                  ; DDOT/DDOTR, i.e. . / .R / D. / D.R) were
                      (    forth6809.asm):19255                                  ; accidentally unaffected - each happens to
                      (    forth6809.asm):19256                                  ; run "LDD SAVEN" (a flag-setting load of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19257                                  ; true signed value) immediately before PSHU
