                      (    forth6809.asm):19758                                      ; entirely (the top-of-file note calling
                      (    forth6809.asm):19759                                      ; out "/HOLD and /PAD... remain explicitly
                      (    forth6809.asm):19760                                      ; incomplete/absent" was accurate at the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19761                                      ; time). Answers HOLDMINSIZE (34), not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19762                                      ; larger PADOFFSET (84) - HOLDMINSIZE is
                      (    forth6809.asm):19763                                      ; specifically the portion of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19764                                      ; CODEHERE-to-PAD gap reserved for the
                      (    forth6809.asm):19765                                      ; pictured numeric output buffer, the same
